WEBVTT

00:00:13.950 --> 00:00:15.750
You finally awake?

00:00:23.700 --> 00:00:25.410
Ow...

00:00:25.410 --> 00:00:28.370
I'm pretty sure something hit me from behind...

00:00:28.370 --> 00:00:30.410
Don't think too hard about that.

00:00:30.410 --> 00:00:31.410
What?

00:00:31.410 --> 00:00:33.790
And Fiena healed your wounds so you're fine.

00:00:33.790 --> 00:00:35.290
Fiena did?

00:00:35.290 --> 00:00:36.750
Now, then...

00:00:36.750 --> 00:00:39.870
How about you lead me to MacDougal?

00:02:11.000 --> 00:02:14.950
"GATHER IN MY FOREST, WOLVES"

00:02:28.080 --> 00:02:29.700
Ow!

00:02:29.700 --> 00:02:33.830
You're just a child who can't
even break away from my grasp.

00:02:33.830 --> 00:02:35.830
I can't just let you die.

00:02:44.040 --> 00:02:48.370
We'll be fine as long as
we leave everything to my master.

00:02:48.370 --> 00:02:50.750
And I'll protect you.

00:02:57.910 --> 00:02:59.660
You're...

00:03:01.410 --> 00:03:03.370
What's the meaning of this?

00:03:03.370 --> 00:03:07.500
I know you're trying to mess
with the heart of this forest.

00:03:09.660 --> 00:03:11.870
Salua!

00:03:11.870 --> 00:03:13.370
What is it that you want?

00:03:13.370 --> 00:03:15.290
Free Fiena.

00:03:15.290 --> 00:03:16.620
Fiena?

00:03:16.620 --> 00:03:18.250
I'm making a deal with you.

00:03:18.250 --> 00:03:23.290
If you agree to the terms,
I'll let you know who's after your life.

00:03:23.290 --> 00:03:27.370
I'll tell you the name of the
Death Instructor from the Kimluck Church.

00:03:27.370 --> 00:03:29.700
You betrayed me, Sorcerer!

00:03:29.700 --> 00:03:32.620
I never intended to work
with an assassin anyway.

00:03:32.620 --> 00:03:33.830
Why you--

00:03:33.830 --> 00:03:36.040
Guide my path, Deathsong Starling!

00:03:45.250 --> 00:03:46.700
What?!

00:03:46.700 --> 00:03:49.620
I unsheathe thee, Sword of Light!

00:03:57.500 --> 00:03:59.410
Release Fiena.

00:04:00.660 --> 00:04:02.370
I refuse.

00:04:02.370 --> 00:04:05.370
Why are you so obsessed
with the heart of this forest?

00:04:05.370 --> 00:04:12.750
Because I need power...
Power to surpass even the Dragon race!

00:04:12.750 --> 00:04:14.120
Don't!

00:04:27.660 --> 00:04:30.160
I saw...

00:04:30.160 --> 00:04:33.290
At Kimluck... And I knew...

00:04:33.290 --> 00:04:36.910
At this rate, the continent would be finished.

00:04:36.910 --> 00:04:39.080
What did you see at Kimluck?

00:04:39.080 --> 00:04:41.200
Hey, tell me!

00:04:58.500 --> 00:05:04.080
Looks like the cylinder that
had been hit with Sorcery overheated.

00:05:04.080 --> 00:05:08.500
Of course, that would happen
if you tried to shoot it in that state.

00:05:08.500 --> 00:05:12.000
Whatever. This just means that my job is done.

00:05:13.540 --> 00:05:16.290
Looks like I can finally leave.

00:05:19.830 --> 00:05:23.620
I'm pretty partial to traitors.

00:05:23.620 --> 00:05:26.330
See ya, Krylancelo.

00:05:30.330 --> 00:05:33.790
I see. I understand the situation, but...

00:05:33.790 --> 00:05:36.410
This land is under the jurisdiction
of the Kimluck Church.

00:05:36.410 --> 00:05:39.410
We can't really interfere...

00:05:39.410 --> 00:05:42.950
We should head back to the station
and wait for the royal family's orders...

00:05:42.950 --> 00:05:48.540
I told you, my friends have been captured!
I don't have time for this!

00:05:54.750 --> 00:05:59.790
Oh, how cute! Come here. I won't hurt you...

00:06:07.950 --> 00:06:10.160
Hey, what's the big idea?

00:06:10.160 --> 00:06:13.040
That's the child of a Deep Dragon.

00:06:13.040 --> 00:06:15.750
Deep Dragon? This little guy?

00:06:18.120 --> 00:06:22.000
Hey, doesn't that mean that the mother's nearby?

00:06:23.450 --> 00:06:26.120
You should get the hell out of here, too!

00:06:28.870 --> 00:06:31.450
Hey, wait!

00:06:31.450 --> 00:06:35.000
Is your mommy really that scary?

00:06:39.410 --> 00:06:41.580
Master MacDougal is dead?

00:06:41.580 --> 00:06:43.870
Apparently his gun spontaneously discharged.

00:06:43.870 --> 00:06:46.580
What do we do now?

00:06:46.580 --> 00:06:48.910
Please tell us, Shrine Maiden.

00:06:48.910 --> 00:06:51.290
Please show us the way.

00:06:51.290 --> 00:06:53.330
Please! Show us the way!

00:06:56.370 --> 00:06:57.950
Shrine Maiden!

00:06:58.580 --> 00:07:00.200
Save us!

00:07:00.200 --> 00:07:02.830
That's enough!

00:07:02.830 --> 00:07:07.040
You're talking about your lives!
Make your own damn choices!

00:07:07.040 --> 00:07:11.330
And you need to release the shrine maiden!

00:07:11.330 --> 00:07:13.660
You can't tell us what to do!

00:07:13.660 --> 00:07:15.120
Yeah!

00:07:15.120 --> 00:07:16.830
Let's go to the heart of this forest!

00:07:16.830 --> 00:07:20.160
We will carry on Master MacDougal's wishes.

00:07:20.160 --> 00:07:22.830
Don't! That's the Dragon's sanctuary!

00:07:22.830 --> 00:07:24.410
You'll all be killed!

00:07:24.410 --> 00:07:27.250
You know about the heart of this forest?

00:07:27.250 --> 00:07:27.910
I...

00:07:27.910 --> 00:07:31.040
Capture him! We'll make him lead us there!

00:07:38.540 --> 00:07:39.200
After him!

00:07:39.200 --> 00:07:40.080
He went over there!

00:07:40.080 --> 00:07:41.370
--Master...
--After him!

00:07:44.450 --> 00:07:46.330
You won't escape!

00:07:47.410 --> 00:07:50.700
The village shall be punished.

00:07:50.700 --> 00:07:53.620
I shall give thou some time.

00:07:53.620 --> 00:07:56.040
Flee that place.

00:07:59.910 --> 00:08:01.410
Majic, go.

00:08:01.410 --> 00:08:02.540
Huh?

00:08:02.540 --> 00:08:04.580
I'll be fine.

00:08:04.580 --> 00:08:07.200
But I...

00:08:07.200 --> 00:08:12.750
You need to face whatever
your heart says you must do right now.

00:08:13.830 --> 00:08:16.790
I'm going to follow my heart, as well.

00:08:16.790 --> 00:08:18.330
Okay.

00:08:18.330 --> 00:08:19.580
I promise I'll be back.

00:08:19.580 --> 00:08:22.290
Okay.

00:08:22.290 --> 00:08:23.620
Where did he go?

00:08:23.620 --> 00:08:26.120
He's so fast!

00:08:26.120 --> 00:08:27.790
Search over there!

00:08:30.450 --> 00:08:34.000
It's not like I can use
Sorcery against normal humans.

00:08:34.000 --> 00:08:36.160
This is turning into a pain in the ass.

00:08:36.160 --> 00:08:38.250
The barn! He headed towards the barn!

00:08:38.250 --> 00:08:39.580
Did you hear that? Let's go!

00:08:39.580 --> 00:08:42.410
Don't let down your guard!
We're dealing with a Sorcerer!

00:08:45.830 --> 00:08:48.250
What's going on?

00:08:48.250 --> 00:08:50.040
This turned into a huge mess.

00:08:50.040 --> 00:08:51.160
This is our chance to escape!

00:08:51.160 --> 00:08:52.290
I found him!

00:08:55.790 --> 00:08:58.750
Flow thus! Angel Breath!

00:09:03.040 --> 00:09:06.080
I guess this stupid thing
is better than nothing.

00:09:08.660 --> 00:09:09.910
Wha?

00:09:09.910 --> 00:09:11.160
Ow...

00:09:11.160 --> 00:09:11.870
Majic?!

00:09:11.870 --> 00:09:12.910
Master!

00:09:12.910 --> 00:09:13.950
What are you doing here?

00:09:13.950 --> 00:09:16.500
I wanted to be of some use...

00:09:16.500 --> 00:09:18.000
Of course, you can't!

00:09:18.000 --> 00:09:19.910
I found him! Over here!

00:09:19.910 --> 00:09:20.660
Let's go.

00:09:20.660 --> 00:09:22.080
Wait for me!

00:09:22.080 --> 00:09:25.370
I found him! Over there!
He's on top of the roof!

00:09:27.040 --> 00:09:31.160
Grab the ladder! The ladder!

00:09:31.160 --> 00:09:32.910
What should we do, Master?

00:09:32.910 --> 00:09:34.830
We've got no choice. We're going to transfer.

00:09:34.830 --> 00:09:36.200
Huh?

00:09:36.200 --> 00:09:40.830
But the success rate is low and we probably
won't go further than ten meters.

00:09:40.830 --> 00:09:41.910
What?

00:09:41.910 --> 00:09:46.830
And if I mess this up, our bodies will
start seething, and we'll be destroyed.

00:09:46.830 --> 00:09:49.370
That sounds insanely dangerous!

00:09:49.370 --> 00:09:50.950
Grab on!

00:09:55.200 --> 00:09:57.500
You'll die if you let go.

00:09:59.700 --> 00:10:02.410
I dance within thee, Heavenly...

00:10:03.160 --> 00:10:04.620
...Castle!

00:10:05.950 --> 00:10:07.370
He disappeared?

00:10:07.370 --> 00:10:09.620
Where'd he go?!

00:10:09.620 --> 00:10:10.870
Hey, where'd he go?

00:10:10.870 --> 00:10:12.290
Find him!

00:10:17.870 --> 00:10:18.660
Did you find him?

00:10:18.660 --> 00:10:19.410
No.

00:10:19.410 --> 00:10:20.450
What about the east?

00:10:20.450 --> 00:10:21.330
He's not here.

00:10:21.330 --> 00:10:23.000
Damn it... Where'd he go?

00:10:24.500 --> 00:10:26.450
Come on. We're leaving the forest.

00:10:26.450 --> 00:10:27.500
Salua.

00:10:27.500 --> 00:10:29.950
That Sorcerer told me to take you and the brat

00:10:29.950 --> 00:10:33.250
and get the hell out of this forest
if a ruckus happened.

00:10:33.250 --> 00:10:34.200
Where's the kid?

00:10:34.200 --> 00:10:36.620
Majic went to Orphen.

00:10:36.620 --> 00:10:39.000
All right, then. Let's go.

00:10:41.250 --> 00:10:46.910
What's the matter? Weren't you crying
about not wanting to be left here alone?

00:10:48.750 --> 00:10:51.200
The village shall be punished.

00:10:51.200 --> 00:10:54.700
Flee that place.

00:10:54.700 --> 00:10:56.330
I cannot leave.

00:10:56.330 --> 00:10:58.370
What?

00:10:58.370 --> 00:11:01.700
I will follow my heart.

00:11:03.700 --> 00:11:06.250
Yes! You did it, Master!

00:11:06.250 --> 00:11:07.040
There he is!

00:11:07.040 --> 00:11:07.450
Huh?

00:11:07.450 --> 00:11:08.870
Right over there!

00:11:08.870 --> 00:11:09.790
Man, they're close!

00:11:09.790 --> 00:11:13.910
I told you! The farthest I can go is ten meters!

00:11:13.910 --> 00:11:16.540
Do I really have to do this?

00:11:24.250 --> 00:11:26.370
The Deep Dragon's Sorcery?

00:11:33.370 --> 00:11:36.660
The Deep Dragon...

00:11:36.660 --> 00:11:39.660
O Dragon...

00:11:39.660 --> 00:11:41.500
O Master...

00:11:41.500 --> 00:11:43.370
Orphen!

00:11:43.370 --> 00:11:44.370
Claiomh!

00:11:44.370 --> 00:11:46.120
What the heck is going on?

00:11:46.120 --> 00:11:47.330
What's that?

00:11:47.330 --> 00:11:48.950
Oh, this little guy?

00:11:48.950 --> 00:11:52.290
Apparently, it's a baby Deep Dragon.

00:11:52.290 --> 00:11:55.700
Ye attempted to commit a taboo.

00:11:55.700 --> 00:11:58.040
Ye shall be destroyed.

00:12:07.620 --> 00:12:09.950
Could you not do that so easily?!

00:12:09.950 --> 00:12:11.540
Save us.

00:12:11.540 --> 00:12:13.450
Please, forgive us!

00:12:15.910 --> 00:12:18.370
I dance within thee,

00:12:18.370 --> 00:12:21.790
Heavenly Castle!

00:12:37.950 --> 00:12:40.000
That didn't work either?

00:12:40.000 --> 00:12:42.290
What are we going to do?

00:12:42.290 --> 00:12:45.040
The Deep Dragon can read our hearts.

00:12:45.040 --> 00:12:48.160
No matter what I try, it'll figure it out.

00:12:58.870 --> 00:13:00.660
Leave!

00:13:00.660 --> 00:13:04.620
Do so, and we'll let the little one go.

00:13:04.620 --> 00:13:08.250
I know that thou aren't serious.

00:13:10.120 --> 00:13:14.120
Regardless, your precious child is in my hands.

00:13:14.120 --> 00:13:16.950
Do as thou wishes.

00:13:16.950 --> 00:13:18.290
What?

00:13:18.290 --> 00:13:22.200
Our Sorcery can bring the dead back to life.

00:13:22.200 --> 00:13:24.500
I shall destroy this village.

00:13:24.500 --> 00:13:29.370
Don't! The villagers here worshiped you!

00:13:29.370 --> 00:13:34.540
I am aware, as I sent in
my familiar as a shrine maiden.

00:13:34.540 --> 00:13:36.000
Shrine maiden?

00:13:36.000 --> 00:13:42.500
We had to keep our eye on MacDougal
as the guardians of the sanctuary.

00:13:43.370 --> 00:13:48.620
MacDougal committed a taboo and
was trying to infiltrate the heart of this forest.

00:13:48.620 --> 00:13:53.370
That's why I revived that girl
who had once died in this forest

00:13:53.370 --> 00:13:55.830
and sent her into the village.

00:13:55.830 --> 00:13:58.830
MacDougal's already dead!

00:13:58.830 --> 00:14:04.660
Even with MacDougal dead,
the villagers are still trying to commit a taboo.

00:14:04.660 --> 00:14:08.410
They made themselves useless... Without value.

00:14:08.410 --> 00:14:09.700
Without value?

00:14:09.700 --> 00:14:13.450
You've got some nerve saying
that after you killed some people.

00:14:13.450 --> 00:14:15.620
I'll take you on!

00:14:15.620 --> 00:14:19.160
Don't harm anyone else until I die!

00:14:26.330 --> 00:14:30.250
Thou should know that has no effect on me.

00:14:36.700 --> 00:14:38.500
Orphen!

00:14:40.500 --> 00:14:43.910
I knit thee thus, Chainmail of Haloes!

00:14:57.500 --> 00:15:00.500
I see... So you're not gods at all.

00:15:00.500 --> 00:15:02.250
You're just Sorcerers, as well.

00:15:02.250 --> 00:15:04.200
Wait, what's going on?

00:15:04.200 --> 00:15:08.410
We Sorcerers use sound
as a medium for our Sorcery.

00:15:08.410 --> 00:15:13.540
But Deep Dragons use what's in their field
of view as a medium and use Dark Sorcery.

00:15:13.540 --> 00:15:18.410
Just like our sound Sorcery
doesn't work where our voices don't reach

00:15:18.410 --> 00:15:23.700
their Dark Sorcery
won't work where they can't see.

00:15:23.700 --> 00:15:25.790
Then we stand a chance!

00:15:27.870 --> 00:15:29.370
Majic, do that one thing!

00:15:29.370 --> 00:15:30.330
That one thing?

00:15:30.330 --> 00:15:32.700
The thing you did when
you were spying on Claiomh.

00:15:38.910 --> 00:15:39.700
Huh?

00:15:39.700 --> 00:15:41.950
Wait, what are you talking about?!

00:15:41.950 --> 00:15:43.250
Hurry!

00:15:44.500 --> 00:15:48.410
I disturb thee, Cage of Light!

00:15:53.370 --> 00:15:56.700
How dare thou obstruct my vision?

00:15:56.700 --> 00:16:01.790
We just caused the light to refract.
Now your Sorcery won't work.

00:16:01.790 --> 00:16:06.450
But that is not enough to defeat me.

00:16:06.450 --> 00:16:08.370
I know.

00:16:08.370 --> 00:16:10.000
Go!

00:16:12.160 --> 00:16:15.830
I construct thee, Spire of the Sun!

00:16:35.120 --> 00:16:37.410
No way! It worked!

00:16:37.410 --> 00:16:39.330
The gun spontaneously discharged.

00:16:39.330 --> 00:16:43.250
The cylinder was heated
after three shots were fired.

00:16:43.250 --> 00:16:47.950
Then I threw it up into the air and
heated it up even more with Sorcery.

00:16:47.950 --> 00:16:51.500
Though I wasn't sure
if it'd actually hit the target.

00:16:51.500 --> 00:16:56.750
But it appears as though
thou was not able to kill me...

00:16:56.750 --> 00:17:04.160
But I still have enough strength...
to destroy thee...

00:17:06.750 --> 00:17:09.950
Krylancelo...

00:17:09.950 --> 00:17:12.450
I know thine name.

00:17:12.450 --> 00:17:15.250
I know your acquaintance.

00:17:15.250 --> 00:17:21.200
And because of my promise to them,
I shall flee for now.

00:17:21.200 --> 00:17:26.250
A promise between a Dragon and a human?
The only one who could do that is...

00:17:30.160 --> 00:17:31.540
But...

00:17:31.540 --> 00:17:35.250
...I will still destroy this village.

00:17:35.250 --> 00:17:37.660
Stop!

00:17:39.410 --> 00:17:41.410
I am Krylancelo!

00:17:41.410 --> 00:17:43.620
There's nothing that I cannot kill!

00:17:43.620 --> 00:17:46.950
That's what Childman promised!

00:17:46.950 --> 00:17:49.830
If you don't stop, I'll kill you all!

00:17:54.040 --> 00:17:56.290
Fiena!

00:17:56.290 --> 00:17:58.330
Why did thou return?

00:17:58.330 --> 00:18:01.120
I gave you the chance to flee.

00:18:01.120 --> 00:18:04.370
Because this is what I'm meant to do.

00:18:04.370 --> 00:18:10.620
By sharing your five senses,
I am able to use Sorcery equal to your own.

00:18:10.620 --> 00:18:14.330
I can at least nullify your power.

00:18:14.330 --> 00:18:18.700
Even if it means destroying thine self?

00:18:18.700 --> 00:18:21.250
I am nothing more than a decoration.

00:18:21.250 --> 00:18:24.950
Even if I am a mere decoration,

00:18:24.950 --> 00:18:28.410
I cannot let these people die!

00:18:30.830 --> 00:18:33.540
I shall protect them even
if it means my own destruction!

00:18:33.540 --> 00:18:37.950
It appears it was a mistake to choose thee.

00:18:37.950 --> 00:18:40.910
I have no more use for thee.

00:18:43.000 --> 00:18:44.700
Fiena!

00:18:44.700 --> 00:18:51.160
Ye do not understand what it
means to muddle the sanctuary.

00:18:51.160 --> 00:18:55.160
You mean massacring several humans at once?

00:18:55.160 --> 00:18:56.870
Precisely.

00:18:56.870 --> 00:19:00.410
You're kidding, right? You've got some nerve!

00:19:00.410 --> 00:19:06.120
Your own child was taken hostage,
and you didn't even care!

00:19:06.120 --> 00:19:08.580
Get 'em!

00:19:23.870 --> 00:19:26.200
I beg of you...

00:19:26.200 --> 00:19:31.290
If we are ruled over, we must obey...

00:19:31.290 --> 00:19:36.250
Just like that child did right now.

00:19:36.250 --> 00:19:40.500
Thou shall eventually understand...

00:19:40.500 --> 00:19:44.950
The freedom thou earned is unmanageable.

00:19:44.950 --> 00:19:49.000
And that is what makes ye dangerous.

00:19:58.120 --> 00:20:00.500
Hup.

00:20:00.500 --> 00:20:02.950
Looks like we survived.

00:20:02.950 --> 00:20:05.450
That damn moneylender.

00:20:05.450 --> 00:20:08.250
Did the Deep Dragon burn him to a crisp?

00:20:10.200 --> 00:20:11.580
That's too bad!

00:20:11.580 --> 00:20:14.870
I'll just have to read him a poem--

00:20:14.870 --> 00:20:18.200
Oho? Why don't we hear it right now?

00:20:25.250 --> 00:20:29.830
Let us go to our new world.

00:20:33.000 --> 00:20:34.290
Fiena.

00:20:34.290 --> 00:20:36.290
Majic!

00:20:36.290 --> 00:20:38.370
I will never forget you.

00:20:38.370 --> 00:20:40.700
Thank you so much.

00:20:40.700 --> 00:20:45.410
Because of you and your master,
I'm no longer a familiar.

00:20:45.410 --> 00:20:47.790
Er, I didn't really...

00:20:47.790 --> 00:20:51.950
I guess I really have been reborn.

00:20:51.950 --> 00:20:52.910
Yeah.

00:20:52.910 --> 00:20:56.000
Majic, I hope you become an amazing Sorcerer.

00:20:56.000 --> 00:20:59.290
Huh? Uh...

00:20:59.290 --> 00:21:02.080
Yeah. Of course!

00:21:09.540 --> 00:21:12.410
Damn it. We wasted so much time.

00:21:12.410 --> 00:21:14.790
And it's all your fault!

00:21:14.790 --> 00:21:17.160
I wonder if Fiena's okay...

00:21:17.160 --> 00:21:19.040
If you're so worried, go with her!

00:21:19.040 --> 00:21:24.950
I couldn't! I'm going to go with you
and become a proper Sorcerer!

00:21:24.950 --> 00:21:30.540
By the way, why didn't the
Deep Dragon see through your plan?

00:21:30.540 --> 00:21:33.540
You mean the Sorcery I told you to use?

00:21:33.540 --> 00:21:35.330
Majic, do that one thing!

00:21:35.330 --> 00:21:36.120
That one thing?

00:21:36.120 --> 00:21:39.040
The thing you did when
you were spying on Claiomh.

00:21:39.040 --> 00:21:42.200
Mental control against White Sorcery.

00:21:42.200 --> 00:21:46.700
It was only for a moment, but I hid my thoughts.

00:21:46.700 --> 00:21:48.410
What the?

00:21:48.410 --> 00:21:51.370
Wait... Are you planning
to bring that thing with us?

00:21:51.370 --> 00:21:56.330
Well, his mommy's gone now. Right, Leki?

00:21:56.330 --> 00:21:58.410
You even named it?

00:21:58.410 --> 00:22:01.370
Ugh, you can't be serious.

00:22:01.370 --> 00:22:04.290
Now I've got another mouth to feed!

00:23:37.950 --> 00:23:40.200
Hey, so what's Tafrem like?

00:23:40.200 --> 00:23:41.200
Is it big? Is it small?

00:23:41.200 --> 00:23:42.830
Is it dangerous? Is it safe?

00:23:42.830 --> 00:23:44.750
Is it boring? Is it fun?

00:23:44.750 --> 00:23:45.000
You'll find out as soon as we get there.

00:23:45.000 --> 00:23:47.000
"An Unexpected Assassin"

00:23:45.000 --> 00:23:47.000
You'll find out as soon as we get there.
